#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_2)
#: lockfilepage.ui:92
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"None, the default configuration, should be safe in most cases.  However, if "
"programs that do not make use of Akonadi are also accessing the configured "
"mbox file, you will need to set an appropriate locking method. Note that if "
"this is the case, the resource and the other programs must all use the same "
"locking method."
msgstr "None, zadani configuration, should biti safe u najviše cases. However, ako programs to učini ne make koristi od Akonadi su also accessing konfiguriran mbox datoteka, vi will need za postavi appropriate locking method. Note to ako ovo je case, resurs i ostali programs must sve koristi isti locking method."

